<p>		     1.4555/65  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.99/00   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8820/30  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1701.5/2.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     112.30/34  Japanese Yen</p>
